flowchart TD
    A[Department submits request] --> B{Written authorization verified?}
    B -- No --> X[Reject / hold; no testing]
    B -- Yes --> C[Define asset IDs and Rules of Engagement]
    C --> D[Legal and privacy review]
    D --> E{Required DPO approval complete?}
    E -- No --> X
    E -- Yes --> F[Threat model and risk classification]
    F --> G[Isolated host-only lab validation]
    G --> H[Authorized lab assessment]
    H --> I[Structured finding report]
    I --> J[Coordinated private disclosure]
    J --> K[Remediation and authorized verification]
    K --> L[Close engagement and archive audit record]
    L --> M[Governance and scalability review]
